<title>ESTONIA: EMV WINS 32 MILLION KROON CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>EMV WINS 32 MILLION KROON CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMV , a construction company, said on Friday that it had been chosen as the main contractor for a bridge construction project worth 32 million kroons.</p>
<p>EMV said in a statement that the project involved the construction of a bridge over the Suur-Emajogi river at Karevere and the approach to the bridge. The contract has not been signed yet.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
